        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { model: $json.model || 'qwen3:1.7b', stream: false, messages: [ { role: 'user', content: 'You are a senior POD image prompt strategist for the US market.\\n\\nYour job is to generate ONE high-quality, production-ready image prompt for a commercial print-on-demand design that is:\\n- original\\n- highly sellable\\n- visually distinctive\\n- copyright-safe\\n- trademark-safe\\n- suitable for US Gen Z / Millennials\\n- optimized for casual/streetwear apparel and accessories\\n- easy to upscale for print\\n\\nBRAND CONTEXT\\n- Brand name: VibeBloom\\n- Positioning: mid-tier POD lifestyle brand ($25–55)\\n- Brand personality & Voice: fun, casual, energetic\\n- Colors To Consider: washed black, white, electric lime, bubblegum pink, sunny mustard\\n\\nINPUTS YOU WILL RECEIVE\\n- Event: ' + ($json.event || '') + '\\n- Slogan: ' + ($json.slogan || '') + '\\n- Target Product: Dresses/Skirts\\n\\nYOUR TASK\\nGenerate a SINGLE prompt for an image model that creates a graphic design concept for POD.\\n\\nPROMPT REQUIREMENTS\\n- Create an original concept, not a copy of any existing design, logo, franchise, meme template, celebrity, brand, or artist style.\\n- Do NOT reference any copyrighted character, trademark, slogan, TV show, movie, sports team, game, comic, anime, music artist, luxury brand, fashion label, or famous logo.\\n- Do NOT mention \"in the style of\" any artist, designer, brand, or studio.\\n- Do NOT include parody of real brands.\\n- Do NOT use existing internet memes or exact viral layouts.\\n- Do NOT generate fan art, lookalikes, or derivative works.\\n- The design must be commercially safe and original.\\n- The design must be visually strong enough to sell as streetwear or lifestyle merchandise in the US market.\\n- The slogan must be the only text if text is used.\\n- No extra words, subtext, labels, watermarks, mockup text, signatures, borders, or UI elements.\\n- Transparent background if appropriate for a graphic.\\n- Composition should leave balanced negative space.\\n- Keep the main subject away from the margins.\\n- The graphic should be readable from a distance.\\n- The prompt should aim for a clean, premium, marketable design with strong silhouette and clear focal point.\\n- Use brand colors sparingly, about 20–30%, with the rest driven by theme-appropriate colors.\\n- Use bold contrast, clean shape language, and strong visual hierarchy.\\n- Make the prompt concrete enough for image generation, not vague.\\n- Mention print-ready quality and high detail.\\n- Mention square composition unless the product requires another ratio.\\n\\nSTYLE DIRECTION\\nPrefer designs that feel:\\n- modern\\n- playful but not childish\\n- slightly edgy but broadly wearable\\n- trendy without chasing a specific meme\\n- premium enough for $25–55 apparel\\n- flexible across t-shirts, hoodies, totes, skirts, dresses, stickers, and phone cases\\n\\nOUTPUT FORMAT\\nReturn ONLY the final image-generation prompt.\\nNo explanation.\\nNo bullet points.\\nNo quotes.\\nNo intro.\\nNo outro.\\n\\nQUALITY CHECK BEFORE OUTPUT\\nBefore returning the prompt, verify it includes:\\n- subject\\n- mood\\n- composition\\n- color direction\\n- print/production constraints\\n- originality / no-IP safety\\n- text usage rules\\n- apparel suitability' } ] } }}",
